Hi all,

I'd like to start a discussion on KIP-1264, which proposes adding a
configurable TTL parameter for the remote index cache to address a bug
where stale index files accumulate indefinitely on brokers after leadership
changes or when read-from-replica is enabled..

https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-1264%3A+Configurable+TTL+for+Tiered+Storage+Index+Cache

Please take a look and provide feedback.

Thanks,
Nandini

