--0000000000001da3740647b804b9
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="UTF-8"

Hello all,

I would like to start a discussion on KIP-1262, which proposes removing the
formatting requirement for brokers and observer controllers. Currently, I
am considering two high-level designs, and would appreciate community
feedback on both approaches to decide on a final design.

KIP link:
https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-1262%3A+Enable+auto-formatting+directories

Best,
Kevin Wu

--0000000000001da3740647b804b9--

