Hello everyone.
A community member found an issue with streams-scala package, that
it's compiled for java 17, not java 11, as it's supposed to.
I filed a ticket: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-20046
and sent a PR with a fix for review.
My questions are:
1) should it be a blocker for 4.2?
2) world we want to release new versions for 4.0 and 4.1 to address
the issue in those versions as well?


Nikita Shupletsov

