Hello!

Just giving a short post-holiday update on this thread :)

There are 2 active blockers for 4.2. The first one is about buffers
used by in-flight produce requests being released back to the buffer
pool leading to records ending up on unintended topics. The second one
is a CVE detected in one of our dependencies. Both are currently being
worked on. The moment they are resolved I am able to create a release
candidate.

Let me know if I have missed something or there is contention on the
last 2 blockers!

Best,
Christo


