Hey Jonah,

Thanks for the KIP and PR! I agree with the motivation for the change and
just wanted to clarify a bit of the wording:

> The new controller, by becoming a candidate and increasing the epoch will
start to trigger frequent leadership elections which it can never win
causing further chaos in the cluster.

It wasn't clear to me why we assume the new controller would become
candidate if other members of the quorum would presumably not grant any
pre-vote requests from this node (it is unable to complete fetch requests
and therefore unable to catch up sufficiently on the log).

Best,
Alyssa

