vaquar khan created KAFKA-20047:
-----------------------------------

             Summary: Tiered Storage Cost Attribution Metrics
                 Key: KAFKA-20047
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-20047
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
          Components: core, log, Tiered-Storage
            Reporter: vaquar khan


This ticket tracks the work for KIP-1267.

The goal is to introduce consumer-level cost attribution metrics for Tiered Storage (KIP-405). currently, operators cannot distinguish which consumer group is responsible for remote storage fetch costs (S3 GETs/Egress). This KIP introduces metrics tagged with client-id to enable accurate chargeback and financial governance.

KIP Wiki: [https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-1267%3A+Tiered+Storage+Cost+Attribution+Metrics]



