Hi Christo,
We found and fixed an issue in ShareConsumer:
https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-20052. The fix has already been
merged in trunk: https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/21265. It's a small
change but impacts share consumers when the underlying topic is deleted. We
prefer to have the fix in 4.2 hence asking will it be appropriate to
cherry-pick?

Regards,
Apoorv Mittal


