> ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
>
>                 Key: KAFKA-20054
>                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-20054
>             Project: Kafka
>          Issue Type: Bug
>            Reporter: Ashokkumar
>            Priority: Major
>
> Hello Team,
> There is a Critical Security Vulnerability reported for the dependency lz4-java-1.8.0 jar used in Kafka-clients project [CVE-2025-66566](https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2025-66566)
> [CVE-2025-12183](https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2025-12183)
> As the lz4 code is now moved to a new package structure and also the latest code base of Kafka-clients is already using it, is there a date where we can get an updated jar into Maven which will incorporate this fix ?



