Hi all,

We are restarting the vote for KIP-1150: Diskless Topics.

Since the previous vote, the KIP has been substantially updated to address
community feedback.

As a reminder, KIP-1150 is a motivational KIP intended to establish the
architectural direction for diskless topics. The specific implementation
details are delegated to separate sub-KIPs, which will be discussed and
voted on individually.

To give you a concrete idea of the path forward, KIP-1163 is already in an
almost-ready-for-review state, so you can see where we are heading after
this.

KIP-1150:
