> * Build 4.2 with the workflows available in 4.1 - successful, albeit failing at a later stage due to a deprecation message (https://github.com/apache/kafka/actions/runs/20923803093)
> * Build 4.2 with trunk - unsuccessful (https://github.com/apache/kafka/actions/runs/20924766209)
> This would seem to suggest that some change in our workflows is causing this hanging behaviour, even though it isn't immediately obvious what.



