Subject: [jira] [Created] (KAFKA-20067) Config synonyms are not returned for
 listener overrides
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 7bit
X-JIRA-FingerPrint: 30527f35849b9dde25b450d4833f0394
From: "Mickael Maison (Jira)" <jira@apache.org>
Reply-To: <dev@kafka.apache.org>

Mickael Maison created KAFKA-20067:
--------------------------------------

             Summary: Config synonyms are not returned for listener overrides
                 Key: KAFKA-20067
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-20067
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Bug
          Components: core
            Reporter: Mickael Maison
            Assignee: Mickael Maison


If a user set listener.name.connections.max.reauth.ms and describe its synonyms, the synonyms returned are only listener.name.connections.max.reauth.ms. It should also contain connections.max.reauth.ms.

The issue is that DynamicBrokerConfig.brokerConfigSynonyms() does not handle listener overrides correctly.



--
