    Resolution: Invalid

Upon further checking per listener configurations need to have the listener name in the config listener.name.<NAME>.<CONFIG>. A comment in DynamicBrokerConfig mentions configs using the listener.name.<CONFIG> format but that seems invalid.

I'll adjust the comment

