+* [KIP-1153: Refactor Kafka Streams CloseOptions to Fluent API Style](https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/x/QAq9F)    
+  Introduces a new fluent-style `CloseOptions` class for Kafka Streams with a `GroupMembershipOperation` enum, improving readability and consistency with other configuration classes.

