This is the RC0 candidate for release of Apache Kafka 3.9.2.

This is a bug-fix & CVE-fix release like CVE-2024-29371, CVE-2025-58057, =
and CVE-2025-48734. In this version, we have a KIP-1252 to align =
AlterConfigPolicy behavior between ZK and Kraft.

Release notes for the 3.9.2 release:
=
https://dist.apache.org/repos/dist/dev/kafka/3.9.2-rc0/RELEASE_NOTES.html

