* Javadoc:
https://dist.apache.org/repos/dist/dev/kafka/3.9.2-rc0/javadoc/

* Tag to be voted upon (off 3.9 branch) is the 3.9.2 tag:
https://github.com/apache/kafka/releases/tag/3.9.2-rc0

* Documentation:
https://kafka.apache.org/39/documentation.html

