> > > /connector-plugins endpoint, the JSON serialized "type" filed in the
> body
> > > response is now uppercase instead of being lowercase as in the past.
> > > Following a comparison between Apache Kafka 4.1 ...
> > >
> > >
> > >
> [{"class":"org.apache.kafka.connect.mirror.MirrorCheckpointConnector","ty=
pe":"source","version":"4.1.1"},{"class":"org.apache.kafka.connect.mirror.M=
irrorHeartbeatConnector","type":"source","version":"4.1.1"},{"class":"org.a=
