Hi Jun,

The 'simpler approach' I mentioned earlier can solve the cross-AZ traffic
costs for both sending and replication simultaneously. And it can easily
integrate with existing Apache Kafka features without having to rewrite
code for Transaction, Queue, Compaction, and so on. And there is no need to
implement it twice in Classic Topic and Diskless Topic when Apache Kafka
adds new features in the future.

Robin

