Mickael Maison created KAFKA-20086:
--------------------------------------

             Summary: Release Process automation
                 Key: KAFKA-20086
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-20086
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
          Components: release
            Reporter: Mickael Maison


The release process consists in a lot of manual steps. A large amount of them could be automated. We should look at automating as much as possible of the process to limit manual issues and speed up the process especially when we need to spin new release candidates.



--
