Hi Robin,

Your proposal actually resonates with what we proposed [1] a little whil=
e ago (nicknamed revision 3), so we exercised similar ideas. We abandone=
d them in favor of the original coordinator-based approach for the reaso=
ns described in the mailing list and summarized in the rejected alternat=
ives of KIP-1163 [2].

If you consider your proposal the alternative to KIP-1163 under the umbr=
ella of KIP-1150, we propose to file a formal KIP so we can have a more =
visible community discussion of the merits of both approach. What do you=
 think?

Best,
Ivan

[1] https://lists.apache.org/thread/w03qffwllynkx5ygvcd48vb3vjvsf8k7
[2] https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=3D3=
50783976#KIP1163:DisklessCore-Coordinator-lessapproaches

