> Hi all,
>
> I finished testing of Kafka 3.9.2 RC0 from Strimzi side.
> All executed pipelines finished successfully:
>
> - KRaft regression
> - ZooKeeper regression
> - Migration from ZooKeeper to Kraft
> - upgrade/downgrade
> - various UTs/ITs
>
> +1 (non-binding) for the release.
> Thank you.
>
> Best regards,
>
> Lukas Kral
>
