Hi all,

I'll be the release manager for the 4.0.2 bugfix release.

The release plan is available at https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/x/Loc8G
.

Although there are no blockers or critical fixes targeted for 4.0.2, I'd
like to give some time to the community to merge anything that is needed,
so I put the code freeze date to *10 Feb *(Tuesday). I expect the first
release candidate to be rolled out a few days after that.

Please let me know if you have any questions or concerns or fixes that
you'd like to include.

Regards,
Viktor

