Abhinav Dixit created KAFKA-20095:
-------------------------------------

             Summary: Unnecessary triggers to delayed share fetch purgatory when no data fetched
                 Key: KAFKA-20095
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-20095
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Bug
    Affects Versions: 4.2.0
            Reporter: Abhinav Dixit
            Assignee: Abhinav Dixit


We noticed elevated CPU consumption when consuming from a large number of share-partitions when no data was fetched because production had been stopped. The issue only occurs when consumption is waiting on more records to be produced.



--
