Hi,

I'd like to volunteer to be the release manager for the Apache Kafka
4.3.0 release.

If there are no objections, I'll start building the release plan.
4.2.0 will now miss January, but I think we should still aim at having
4.3.0 in May

Thanks,
Mickael

